---
title: SudsTrack — System Flowchart
---
flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> VISIT[User visits SudsTrack website]
    VISIT --> LANDING[Landing Page: index.html\nBrowse Promotions · See Packages]

    LANDING --> AUTH_CHOICE{Authenticated?}

    %% ── AUTHENTICATION BRANCH ────────────────────────
    AUTH_CHOICE -->|No| LOGIN_PAGE[Login Page\npages/auth/login.html]
    AUTH_CHOICE -->|Yes| ROLE_CHECK{Check Role}

    LOGIN_PAGE --> LOGIN_METHOD{Login Method}
    LOGIN_METHOD -->|Email + Password| CRED_CHECK{Validate credentials\nCheck lockout}
    LOGIN_METHOD -->|Google OAuth| GOOGLE[Google OAuth 2.0\nPassport.js Strategy]

    CRED_CHECK -->|Invalid / Banned| LOGIN_ERR[Show error\nIncrement attempts]
    LOGIN_ERR --> MAX_ATTEMPTS{">= 10 fails?"}
    MAX_ATTEMPTS -->|Yes| LOCKOUT[Lock account 5 min\nLog security event]
    MAX_ATTEMPTS -->|No| LOGIN_PAGE
    LOCKOUT --> LOGIN_PAGE

    CRED_CHECK -->|Valid| TWO_FA_CHECK{2FA enabled?}
    TWO_FA_CHECK -->|Yes| TOTP_VERIFY[Enter TOTP code\nverify-login-2fa]
    TOTP_VERIFY -->|Invalid| LOGIN_ERR
    TOTP_VERIFY -->|Valid| SET_COOKIE[Set JWT httpOnly cookie\n sudstrack_token]

    TWO_FA_CHECK -->|No| SET_COOKIE
    GOOGLE --> GOOGLE_CB[Google Callback\nCreate/find account in DB]
    GOOGLE_CB --> SET_COOKIE

    SET_COOKIE --> LOG_SESSION[Log session to DB\nsessions table]
    LOG_SESSION --> ROLE_CHECK

    %% ── NEW USER / REGISTRATION ──────────────────────
    LANDING --> REGISTER_PAGE[Register Page\npages/auth/registration.html]
    REGISTER_PAGE --> REGISTER_FORM[Submit: name, email, password]
    REGISTER_FORM --> EMAIL_TAKEN{Email already exists?}
    EMAIL_TAKEN -->|Yes| REG_ERR[Error: email taken]
    REG_ERR --> REGISTER_PAGE
    EMAIL_TAKEN -->|No| HASH_PW[Hash password bcrypt]
    HASH_PW --> INSERT_ACCOUNT[INSERT into accounts\nrole = Customer]
    INSERT_ACCOUNT --> SET_COOKIE

    %% ── FORGOT PASSWORD ──────────────────────────────
    LOGIN_PAGE --> FORGOT[Forgot Password flow]
    FORGOT --> EMAIL_LOOKUP{Account exists?}
    EMAIL_LOOKUP -->|No| PW_ERR[Generic message shown]
    EMAIL_LOOKUP -->|Yes| TOKEN_GEN[Generate reset code\nStore hashed token in DB]
    TOKEN_GEN --> SEND_EMAIL[Send code via Email\nNodemailer / Gmail SMTP]
    SEND_EMAIL --> VERIFY_CODE[User enters code]
    VERIFY_CODE --> CODE_VALID{Valid & not expired?}
    CODE_VALID -->|No| PW_ERR
    CODE_VALID -->|Yes| NEW_PW[Set new password\nHash & update accounts table]
    NEW_PW --> LOGIN_PAGE

    %% ── ROLE-BASED ROUTING ──────────────────────────
    ROLE_CHECK -->|Customer| CUSTOMER_DASH[My Account Page\npages/user/account.html]
    ROLE_CHECK -->|Staff / SuperAdmin| ADMIN_DASH[Admin Dashboard\npages/admin/admin.html]

    %% ── CUSTOMER FLOW ───────────────────────────────
    CUSTOMER_DASH --> CUSTOMER_ACTIONS{Customer Action}
    CUSTOMER_ACTIONS -->|Browse Packages| PKG_PAGE[Packages Page\npages/user/packages.html]
    CUSTOMER_ACTIONS -->|View Orders| VIEW_ORDERS[Load orders from\nGET /api/orders/my]
    CUSTOMER_ACTIONS -->|Edit Profile| EDIT_PROFILE[PUT /api/account/profile]
    CUSTOMER_ACTIONS -->|Change Password| CHANGE_PW[POST /api/account/change-password]
    CUSTOMER_ACTIONS -->|2FA Settings| TWO_FA_SETUP[Setup TOTP 2FA\nGenerate QR for authenticator app]
    CUSTOMER_ACTIONS -->|Leave Feedback| FEEDBACK_FORM[POST /api/feedback\nAfter Completed order]
    CUSTOMER_ACTIONS -->|Contact Us| CONTACT[POST /api/contact]

    %% ── BOOKING FLOW ────────────────────────────────
    PKG_PAGE --> SELECT_PKGS[Select one or more packages\nSaved to localStorage]
    SELECT_PKGS --> BOOKING_PAGE[Booking Page\npages/user/booking.html]
    BOOKING_PAGE --> STEP1[Step 1: Details\nName, address, load size, pickup & delivery slots]
    STEP1 --> WEATHER_CHECK[Check weather forecast\nGET /api/weather via OpenWeatherMap]
    WEATHER_CHECK --> WEATHER_WARN{Rain warning?}
    WEATHER_WARN -->|Yes| SHOW_WARN[Display weather banner\n Proceed anyway]
    WEATHER_WARN -->|No| STEP2
    SHOW_WARN --> STEP2
    STEP1 --> STEP2[Step 2: Payment\nCash or Online]
    STEP2 -->|Online| PAYMENT_MODAL[Online Payment Simulation Modal\nSimulate / Cancel]
    PAYMENT_MODAL -->|Cancelled| STEP2
    PAYMENT_MODAL -->|Confirmed| MARK_PAID[Set payment_status = Paid]
    MARK_PAID --> STEP3
    STEP2 -->|Cash| STEP3
    STEP3[Step 3: Review\nSummary of all details]
    STEP3 --> CONFIRM_BTN[Confirm Booking]

    CONFIRM_BTN --> VALIDATE{All fields valid?}
    VALIDATE -->|No| VALIDATION_ERR[Show validation errors]
    VALIDATION_ERR --> STEP1
    VALIDATE -->|Yes| POST_ORDER[POST /api/orders\npackage_ids array]

    POST_ORDER --> DB_ORDER[INSERT orders\nINSERT payments]
    DB_ORDER --> SEND_SMS[Send SMS confirmation\nvia Semaphore API]
    SEND_SMS --> SUCCESS_SCREEN[Step 4: Booking Confirmed!\nShow order code SD-XXXX]
    SUCCESS_SCREEN --> CUSTOMER_DASH

    %% ── ORDER TRACKING ──────────────────────────────
    VIEW_ORDERS --> ORDER_STATUS{Order Status}
    ORDER_STATUS -->|Out for Delivery| TRACK_BTN[Track Rider button visible\nGET /api/orders/:id/tracking]
    TRACK_BTN --> MAPS_API[Google Maps Directions API\nDraw route from shop to address]
    MAPS_API --> SHOW_MAP[Show map + ETA + distance]
    ORDER_STATUS -->|Completed| FEEDBACK_FORM
    ORDER_STATUS -->|Completed| SAVED_ORDERS[Star / Save order\nPOST /api/orders/:id/save]

    %% ── ADMIN / STAFF FLOW ──────────────────────────
    ADMIN_DASH --> ADMIN_TABS{Admin Tab}
    ADMIN_TABS -->|Orders| MANAGE_ORDERS[View all orders\nGET /api/admin/orders]
    ADMIN_TABS -->|Customers| MANAGE_CUSTOMERS[View/Edit/Ban customers\nGET/PUT/DELETE /api/admin/customers]
    ADMIN_TABS -->|Staff| MANAGE_STAFF[SuperAdmin: Add/Edit/Deactivate staff\nGET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/admin/staff]
    ADMIN_TABS -->|Riders| MANAGE_RIDERS[Add/Edit/Delete riders\nGET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/riders]
    ADMIN_TABS -->|Packages| MANAGE_PKGS[Create/Edit/Delete packages\nPOST/PUT/DELETE /api/admin/packages]
    ADMIN_TABS -->|Promotions| MANAGE_PROMOS[CRUD promotions\nPOST/PUT/DELETE /api/promotions]
    ADMIN_TABS -->|Analytics| ANALYTICS[View charts & stats\nGET /api/admin/analytics]
    ADMIN_TABS -->|Audit Logs| AUDIT[View audit log\nGET /api/admin/audit-logs]
    ADMIN_TABS -->|Security Events| SEC_LOGS[View security events\nGET /api/admin/security-events]
    ADMIN_TABS -->|Chat| CHAT[Customer chat rooms\nGET/POST /api/chat]
    ADMIN_TABS -->|Staff Chat| STAFF_CHAT[Internal staff chat\nGET/POST /api/staff-chat]

    MANAGE_ORDERS --> UPDATE_STATUS[Update order status\nPUT /api/admin/orders/:id/status]
    UPDATE_STATUS --> STATUS_PIPELINE[Received → Washing → Drying\n→ Ready for Delivery → Out for Delivery → Completed]
    UPDATE_STATUS --> NOTIFY_CUSTOMER[Insert notification\nSend SMS update to customer]
    UPDATE_STATUS --> ASSIGN_RIDER{Assigning rider?}
    ASSIGN_RIDER -->|Yes| RIDER_SELECT[Link rider_id to order\nRiders fetched from riders table]

    STATUS_PIPELINE --> END_STATUS([Order Complete])

    MANAGE_ORDERS --> CANCEL_ORDER[Cancel order\nPUT /api/admin/orders/:id/cancel]

    END([END])
    END_STATUS --> END
    SUCCESS_SCREEN -.-> END
